  "details": "You get to know a lot of people, but not everyone you want to stay in contact with is automatically by definition a \"friend\" you always and under all circumstances want to be around. There are several people who misinterpret an accepted friend request as a literal close friendship.\n\nBeyond that it would also allow to change the available instance types as follows:\n\n- \"Public\"\n\n(anyone, publicly listed instance)\n\n- \"Contacts\"\n\n(contacts and friends)\n\n- \"Contacts+\"\n\n(contacts, friends and beyond, but not publicly listed)\n\n- \"Friends only\"",
